        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SVY875017SBR Decorative 17 Inch Ornate Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 17 Inch Castle Door Pull is made from cast solid brass and completed in your choice of popular, high-quality finishes. It has a beautiful, ornate design that makes it great for a traditional home. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST04-specifications.gif?v=1704354544\" width=\"489\" height=\"235\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions SVY875017SBR Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in shorter version: <a href=\"/products/10-inch-castle-door-pull-first-impressions-svy875010sbr\"><b>10 Inch Castle Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SVY875017SBR Castle Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST04-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions SVY875017SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
