                "title": "17 Inch Ornate Door Pull",
                "description": "The 17 Inch Castle Door Pull is made from cast solid brass and completed in your choice of popular, high-quality finishes. It has a beautiful, ornate design that makes it great for a traditional home. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting.",
